      "quote": "What is already known on this topic Effective prophylaxis for covid-19 could have a global impact in preventing infection and attenuating disease This is the second iteration of our living network meta-analysis on prophylaxis for covid-19 What this study adds",
      "reason": "The review explains the importance and need for the review (effective prophylaxis could have global impact) and situates this work as an updated living network meta-analysis addressing that need."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e3",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_2",
      "quote": "This is the second version (first update) of the living systematic review, replacing the previous version (available as a data supplement).",
      "reason": "The manuscript identifies a prior iteration and indicates this is an update, explaining the need for the current review as a continuation/update of a previous review."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e4",
      "status": "MISSING",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "No retrieved evidence describes the proposed mechanism of action of the prophylactic interventions."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e5",
      "status": "MISSING",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
