      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_16",
      "quote": "Outcomes were analysed regardless of whether they were pre-specified in a protocol or trial registration.",
      "reason": "The text indicates outcomes were analysed regardless of pre-specification and describes what data were extracted for outcome types, but it does not explicitly state whether all compatible results (e.g. all measures, all time points, all analyses) within each outcome domain were sought, so this is only partially addressed."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_10a_e4",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_16",
      "quote": "Because of inconsistent reporting across trials, when possible, we preferentially extracted participant characteristics and outcome data for participants with a polymerase chain reaction (PCR) test that was negative for SARS-CoV-2 infection at baseline. If authors did not report data separately for those who were PCR-negative for SARS-CoV-2 infection at baseline, we extracted data from all participants, regardless of their PCR status at baseline.",
      "reason": "When not all compatible results were available/reported, the manuscript describes the process used to select which results to extract (preference for PCR-negative participants; otherwise using all participants)."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_10a_e5",
      "status": "MISSING",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "No evidence was found reporting changes to outcome-domain inclusion, definitions, or importance, or providing rationales for such changes."
